.TH "CRYSTAL\-RUN" "1" "2026-07-23" "crystal 1.21.0" "Crystal Compiler Command Line Reference Guide"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.nh
.ad l
.de URL
\fI\\$2\fP <\\$1>\\$3
..
.als MTO URL
.if \n[.g] \{\
.  mso www.tmac
.  am URL
.    ad l
.  .
.  am MTO
.    ad l
.  .
.  LINKSTYLE blue R < >
.\}
.SH "نام (NAME)"
crystal-run \- Compile and run a Crystal program
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBcrystal run\fP [options] [programfile] [\-\-] [arguments]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
The default command. Compile and run program.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
Same as the build options.